# ---- Model weight files — NEVER commit these to GitHub ----
# These belong on Hugging Face (via upload_weights.py), not in git history.
# GitHub hard-caps individual files at 100MB and isn't built for LFS-scale
# model artifacts the way HF is.
*.pth
*.onnx
*.h5
*.bin
*.safetensors
Model1_CrowdDensity/**/artifacts/
Model2_Fall_Detection/**/artifacts/
Model3_Person_Reidentification/**/artifacts/
Model3_Person_Reidentification/**/*.pt

# ---- Local copies of weights staged for upload ----
# If you keep a temp local folder with copies of your 3 .pt files before
# running upload_weights.py, ignore it too:
local_weights/
deployment/local_weights/

# ---- Database ----
# Backend/varisetu.db is currently tracked in the repo from earlier commits —
# fine to leave as-is for the demo seed data, but stop tracking it going
# forward so real operational data never lands in git history:
Backend/varisetu.db

# ---- Frontend build artifacts ----
Frontend/node_modules/
Frontend/dist/

